@NovaKnowledge.Search.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003

### Hybrid search query
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Search.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "PTO policy", "tenantId": "contoso", "topK": 5, "useHybrid": true }

### Ensure the search index exists
POST {{NovaKnowledge.Search.Api_HostAddress}}/api/search/index/ensure
Accept: application/json

###
